  <div class="w-embed"></div><div class="hero3" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-fc5920b651f35b.jpg"/></div><div class="hero-image-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content-wrapper"><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Suite Pénard</div><h1 class="light">The right amount of everything.</h1></div></div></div><div class="room-subhero-section"><div class="container"><div class="banner"><div class="collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="banner-collection-list w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/><p class="faq-question-title">Garden View</p></div></div><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-1e6e73d27d5690.svg"/><p class="faq-question-title">Private Patio</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-halves"><div class="main-content"><p class="feature-paragraph smaller">Junior Suite · 6 suites · 30m² · 2 guests</p><h3>Suite Pénard</h3><p>French windows, a private patio, and morning light that arrives exactly on time. Pénard is the smallest of our categories, but it is perhaps the most precise. Built into the original stone structures, these suites are exercises in restraint and curated comfort.</p><p class="italics">The cabinet is stocked with full bottles rather than miniatures — Côtes de Provence rosé, white and red from local producers, champagne, regional provisions, and the Toile Blanche bonbons that guests tend to mention unprompted.</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button w-button distributor-open" href="#">Reserve</a></div></div><div class="secondary-content"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">King size Tréca bed</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Air conditioning</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Free WiFi</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Flat screen TV</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">In-room safe</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bean-to-cup coffee machine</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Curated minibar</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Les Grandes Vacances toiletries</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bluetooth audio system</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Private patio</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Walk-in shower</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bathrobes &amp; slippers</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="full-frame-slider-wrapper"><div class="full-frame-slider w-slider" data-animation="cross" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="500" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="true" data-nav-spacing="3"><div class="slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0d4fab6cd496a8.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-eb795e7700a147.jpg"/></div></div></div><div class="left-arrow w-slider-arrow-left"><img alt="arrow left" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-62e87937b486a8.svg"/></div><div class="right-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><img alt="arrow right" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-7d7a86fb467f08.svg"/></div><div class="slide-nav w-slider-nav w-slider-nav-invert w-round"></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="grid-layout"><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding right-padding"><p class="feature-paragraph">Splendid bright suite of 30m². Warm and contemporary details offer a luxurious feeling of well-being.</p></div><div class="divider _144px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper medium-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Attention to details for a carefree stay.</p></div></div></div><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb56b"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed small-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-094fcbfa61e6c6.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Cosy reading nook to devour your latest book or magazine.</p></div></div><div class="divider _96px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb577"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-10b72a39c9c06b.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>A soothing colour palette and premium bedding ensures a relaxing atmosphere.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Explore other Suites</h2></div></div><div class="rooms-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="room-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="/suites/bonvivant"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite du Bon-Vivant" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-707417a43d47ee.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite du Bon-Vivant</div></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="/suites/masartiste"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Mas de l'Artiste" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-6106adc613aeb2.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Mas de l'Artiste</div></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="/suites/suiteaartiste"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite de l'Artiste" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e1708f1e9761a9.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de l'Artiste</div></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="/suites/penequet"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Villa du Pénéquet" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5f8a45f5b552ed.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Villa du Pénéquet</div></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="/suites/bronzette"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite de la Bronzette" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-8626fb58027da5.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de la Bronzette</div></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="/suites/suite-petanque"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite Pétanque" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-833a78c568fe35.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Pétanque</div></div></a></div></div></div></div>

